                "description": "The Franklin Handleset is a great addition to any classic home. The traditional style allows for this Two Piece Franklin Entry Door Lockset to blend seamlessly into almost any decor. It is available in dummy and single cylinder functions and comes as a complete set, packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a standard 2-1/8 inch prepped door. The Franklin Entrance Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
